    tocShadow: '🧪 Shadow rules',
    shH: '🧪 Shadow rules: candidate rules tracked live (not active)',
    shLede: (a, s) => `The two candidates below backtest better after 2010 but are identical to v3 over 1993–2009, so the walk-forward test cannot confirm them — adopting them now would be tuning to 2023–24. From <b>${s}</b> their recommendations are recorded daily next to the official rule, <b>without acting on them</b>. Adoption criteria set in advance: at <b>${a.review_after}</b> (24 months), or after an S&P 500 drawdown of 15%+ has fully recovered, if a shadow’s <b>live Sharpe and Calmar both exceed</b> the official rule’s since ${s}, it becomes the next rule version on the first day of the following month.`,
