    liveNote: (p) => `$100,000 invested from the first month with data, ${p.start}: the equity part in SPY (dividends reinvested), the rest in 3-month T-bills; ${p.cost_bps} bp charged on each change of exposure, none for buy-and-hold. Before ${p.live_start} the current rule is recomputed monthly; from then on the share recorded each day is applied daily (the ex-ante record, vertical line). Return statistics use monthly data through ${p.metrics_through}; value and drawdown are updated to ${p.end}.`,
