    srcH: '⑧ Data sources',
    srcLede: (m) => `All data is free and public, fetched daily at 22:30 UTC by GitHub Actions (manual re-runs are recorded as workflow_dispatch in manifest.json). Macro series come from <a href="https://fred.stlouisfed.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">FRED</a> (Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis). Access method this run: <b>${m === 'api' ? 'official FRED API (API key configured)' : 'FRED public CSV download, no API key required'}</b>. FRED is an aggregator; the “Original source” column shows where each series really comes from.`,
    srcFredH: 'Macro series (FRED)',
