    srcPxNote: 'Monthly <b>adjusted</b> closes (dividends reinvested) via the open-source yfinance library. Yahoo is not an official data API and can occasionally fail or change; for research use only. For sturdier prices, swap in Tiingo / Stooq / Alpha Vantage (registration required).',
    srcPipeH: 'Pipeline',
    srcPipe: `<li><code>pipeline/fetch.py</code> downloads every raw series listed above;</li>
      <li><code>pipeline/analyze.py</code> computes the spectra, band decomposition, investment clock, credit gap, Bayesian probability and backtest, writing <code>site/data/dashboard.json</code>;</li>
      <li>each run writes one row of the core indicator to <code>site/data/history.csv</code>: recommended equity share (three presets), stance, inputs and that day’s 12-month predictions; past rows are never edited;</li>
      <li>this page only reads that JSON and draws the charts in your browser.</li>`,
